0:00:00.000,0:00:03.000
(quietly) Can you keep it down?

0:00:03.500,0:00:06.500
(sighing) I can't believe this is happening.

0:00:07.000,0:00:10.000
(whispering) Don't tell anyone about this.

0:00:10.500,0:00:13.500
(applause) Thank you, thank you all!

0:00:14.000,0:00:17.000
(laughing) That's the funniest thing I've heard!

0:00:17.500,0:00:20.500
(crying) I just can't do this anymore.

0:00:21.000,0:00:24.000
(shouting) Get out of here right now!

0:00:24.500,0:00:27.500
(singing) La la la la la la la.

0:00:28.000,0:00:31.000
(breathing heavily) I need to rest a moment.

0:00:31.500,0:00:34.500
(gasping) What on earth is that?

0:00:35.000,0:00:38.000
(murmuring) The crowd grows restless.

0:00:38.500,0:00:41.500
(cheering) We did it! We actually did it!
